# The blocker's own Indestructible instead of the attacker's: Spearbreaker
# Behemoth (5/5) blocks Craw Wurm (6/4) and takes 6 damage -- past its 5
# toughness, ordinary-lethal without the keyword -- and survives anyway.
# The Behemoth's own 5 power is still exactly lethal to the Wurm's 4
# toughness back.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks 2=1
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
advance
